<title>JAPAN: Joshin Denki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Joshin Denki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996Z  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		118.94		vs	  107.95</p>
<p> Operating	    1.27		vs	    1.12</p>
<p> Current		2.85		vs	    2.13</p>
<p> Net		    1.77		vs	  683 million</p>
<p> EPS		   31.74 yen	  vs	   12.25 yen</p>
<p> Shares		56 million	 vs	   56 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Joshin Denki Co Ltd is a top mass-sales chain store selling house-hold appliances.</p>
</text>
